Bind Npc 26054 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910053000
        Say "I'm the Sentinel of Keys, the guardian of the fourth key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Third Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Who is the son of the emperor of El Morad abandoned in the wilderness?"
            Topic "Manes" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910053000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Third Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys."
            Topic "Xigenon" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910053000
                    Give 1 of 910054000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Sentinel of Keys, the guardian of the fourth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Third Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
